.TH CF-PAGES 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf-pages.1 \- Manage Cloudflare Pages projects, deployments, and custom domains
.PP
Manage Cloudflare Pages projects, deployments, build configurations, and custom domains.
.PP
.PP
.SH REQUIRED PERMISSIONS
.PP
.PP
.RS 2
.TP
Read
\fIScope Level:\fR Account | \fIMinimum API Token Permission:\fR \fBCloudflare Pages:Read\fR
.TP
Write
\fIScope Level:\fR Account | \fIMinimum API Token Permission:\fR \fBCloudflare Pages:Edit\fR
.RE
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SH SUBCOMMANDS OVERVIEW
.PP
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages list\fR (#cf-pages-list) — List all Pages projects in an account
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages get\fR (#cf-pages-get) — Get project details, production branch, and latest deployment
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages create\fR (#cf-pages-create) — Create a new Pages project
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages delete\fR (#cf-pages-delete) — Remove a Pages project
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages deployments\fR (#cf-pages-deployments) — Inspect and trigger preview or production deployments
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf pages domains\fR (#cf-pages-domains) — Manage custom domains associated with a project
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf pages list\fR"
.PP
Lists all Pages projects in your account.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf pages list
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf pages create\fR"
.PP
Creates a new Pages project.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf pages create --name <project-name> [--production-branch <branch>]
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBExample\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf pages create --name my-marketing-site --production-branch main
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf pages deployments\fR"
.PP
Manage deployments for preview branches and production.
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
# List recent deployments for a project
cf pages deployments list --project my-marketing-site

# Get status, logs, and preview URL of a specific deployment
cf pages deployments get --project my-marketing-site --id <deployment-id>

# Trigger a direct upload deployment from a local build directory
cf pages deployments create --project my-marketing-site --directory ./dist [--branch preview]

# Rollback project to a previous deployment
cf pages deployments rollback --project my-marketing-site --id <deployment-id> --yes
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf pages domains\fR"
.PP
Map apex domains and subdomains to your Pages application.
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
# List all custom domains mapped to the project
cf pages domains list --project my-marketing-site

# Add a custom domain (auto-configures SSL and DNS verification)
cf pages domains add --project my-marketing-site --domain blog.example.com

# Delete a custom domain binding
cf pages domains delete --project my-marketing-site --domain blog.example.com --yes
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
